<view class="page">
  <view class="section">学年</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="line">
      <text>当前学年</text>
      <text class="value">{{year}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="line">
      <text>下一学年</text>
      <input class="input" value="{{nextYear}}" bindinput="onNextYear" />
    </view>
    <button class="btn btn--ghost btn-top" bindtap="onArchive">切换学年</button>
  </view>

  <view class="section">任命新主席</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="line">
      <text>勾选成员</text>
      <text class="value">已选 {{selectedCount}} 人</text>
    </view>
    <scroll-view class="member-list" scroll-y>
      <view
        class="member {{item.role === 'chairman' ? 'member--disabled' : ''}}"
        wx:for="{{members}}"
        wx:key="_id"
        data-id="{{item._id}}"
        bindtap="onToggle"
      >
        <view class="checkbox {{item.checked ? 'checkbox--on' : ''}}">{{item.checked ? '✓' : ''}}</view>
        <view class="member__main">
          <view class="member__name">
            {{item.name}}
            <text class="member__tag" wx:if="{{item.role === 'chairman'}}">现任主席</text>
          </view>
          <view class="member__sub">{{item.studentNo}} · {{item.deptLabel}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </scroll-view>
    <button class="btn btn--ghost btn-top" bindtap="onAppointChairman">任命为主席</button>
  </view>

  <view class="section">任命新部长</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="line">
      <text>学号</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        type="number"
        maxlength="10"
        placeholder="10 位学号"
        value="{{ministerNo}}"
        bindinput="onMinisterNo"
      />
    </view>
    <view class="line">
      <text>所属部门</text>
      <picker range="{{depts}}" range-key="label" value="{{deptIndex}}" bindchange="onDept">
        <view class="value">{{depts[deptIndex].label}}</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <button class="btn btn--ghost btn-top" bindtap="onAppointMinister">任命为部长</button>
  </view>

  <view class="tip">
    协会可有多位主席与多位部长，任命不会降级现任成员；任命后会向对方发送站内消息。学年切换只改统计口径，不会删除历史数据。
  </view>
</view>
